Source: timescaledb-toolkit
Section: database
Priority: optional
Maintainer: Ruohang Feng <rh@vonng.com>
Build-Depends: debhelper-compat (= 13), postgresql-all (>= 217~), cargo, clang, rustc, gcc, make, pkg-config, libssl-dev
Standards-Version: 4.7.2
Rules-Requires-Root: no
Homepage: https://github.com/timescale/timescaledb-toolkit

Package: postgresql-PGVERSION-timescaledb-toolkit
Architecture: any
Provides: postgresql-timescaledb-toolkit
Depends: ${postgresql:Depends}, ${shlibs:Depends}, ${misc:Depends}
Description: analytical hyperfunctions for PostgreSQL and TimescaleDB PGVERSION
 TimescaleDB Toolkit provides approximate aggregates, counter and gauge
 analysis, time-weighted averages, state tracking, downsampling, and SQL
 pipeline utilities. This package supports PostgreSQL 16 through 18 and can be
 used with plain PostgreSQL or TimescaleDB.
